# divedrop.app shows the DiveDrop pages, which live under /divedrop/ in this repo.
# Rules with a host only apply to that host; strategea.be is unaffected.

https://www.divedrop.app/*               https://divedrop.app/:splat   301!

# Paths from the strategea.be layout, typed on the new domain.
# (Netlify ignores a trailing slash when matching, so never redirect /x to /x/: that loops.)
https://divedrop.app/divedrop            https://divedrop.app/         301!
https://divedrop.app/divedrop/*          https://divedrop.app/:splat   301!

https://divedrop.app/*                   /divedrop/:splat              200!

# The old addresses moved there for good. The shipped apps and the store listings
# still link to strategea.be/divedrop/privacy and the review samples; these keep them working.
https://strategea.be/divedrop            https://divedrop.app/         301!
https://strategea.be/divedrop/*          https://divedrop.app/:splat   301!
https://www.strategea.be/divedrop        https://divedrop.app/         301!
https://www.strategea.be/divedrop/*      https://divedrop.app/:splat   301!
